# ${SRC_DIR}/lib/

Framework-agnostic helpers for ${PROJECT_NAME}. No React imports, no DOM access beyond `window.fetch` — anything that reaches into JSX belongs in `components/` or a feature folder.

## What lives here

- [`api-client.ts`](api-client.ts) — fetch wrapper with base-URL handling.
- [`format.ts`](format.ts) — pure formatting helpers.

## What does NOT live here

- React components → `${SRC_DIR}/components/` or a feature.
- Hooks → `${SRC_DIR}/hooks/` or a feature.
- Network calls specific to one feature → `features/<name>/services/`.

